    "C"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>The time period of a simple pendulum is given by,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><msqrt><mfrac><mi>l</mi><mi>g</mi></mfrac></msqrt></math>.</p><p>Therefore,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>T</mi><mo>&#8733;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mi>g</mi></msqrt></mfrac></math>.</p><p>The acceleration due to gravity at height&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>h</mi></math>&nbsp;from the surface of the earth is given by,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>g</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>g</mi><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></math></p><p>Therefore,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><msub><mi>g</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>g</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfrac></msqrt><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow></mfrac><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>3200</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>km</mi></math></p></blockquote>"
  }
}